otherwise in its SPDX header. It includes or derives from the following works; their notices are kept in the file
headers.

- sudoingx dsv41_recipe (Apache-2.0): the quantization passes (p0-p6, step5q/, caldata/, the 2-box scripts) are ports
  of its DeepSeek-V4.1 scripts; each derived file names the script it was ported from.
- 0xSero step5_spark vLLM plugin (https://huggingface.co/0xSero/Step-5-Preview-Spark; files carry Apache-2.0 or MIT
  SPDX headers): serve/patch/step5_spark.orig/ is the plugin as shipped in the serving image, unmodified;
  serve/patch/step5_spark/ holds modified copies of some of its files plus new modules.
