  as their headers state.
- TensorFold (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/ashhart/TensorFold, fork https://github.com/bertholomus/TensorFold):
  serve/patch/step5_spark/tf_exl3/ is vendored from it; see that directory's NOTICE, LICENSE, LICENSE-MIT and
  PROVENANCE.md.
- ExLlamaV3 (MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Turboderp, https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3): the EXL3 format and the
